k":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"A Natural Touch","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-5-base","text":"<p>Style shells on wooden surfaces or with accessories like driftwood, wooden beads, trays, or bowls for a natural, rustic look. Mix round and pointy shells together to create visual contrast.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_k9cREM":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/c56ee03e52a9768791dcdf8cef96bfd39d191546.jpg","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"natural","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Glowing Centerpieces","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-5-base","text":"<p>For stunning centerpieces, arrange mostly light-colored shells of varying shapes in a glass bowl, adding pops of color with our colorful sea urchins and a candle or light to make it glow.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_GT3K3f":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/951ed3760d134f9449227c6a50817f7b7889120d.jpg","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"natural","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Functional Decor","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-5-base","text":"<p>Show your customers how shells can be functional too, by using them as a jewelry or soap dish in the bathroom, or a key tray in the entryway. There are many ways to use them around the house!<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["image_column_MA9tWy","image_column_k9cREM","image_column_GT3K3f"],"name":"t